{"seq":4,"slug":"reading-medical-research","title":"读懂医学研究","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 读懂医学研究\n\n医学研究论文是现代循证医学的基石。无论是随机对照试验、队列研究还是系统综述，每一篇发表的论文都承载着从假说到验证的完整科学逻辑。然而，面对浩如烟海的医学文献，普通读者往往感到无从下手——复杂的统计术语、多样的研究设计、潜在的偏倚风险，这些都构成了理解医学研究的障碍。\n\n本 Hub 旨在帮助读者系统掌握阅读和评判医学研究论文的核心能力。从研究方法论的基本框架出发，逐步深入到证据评估的关键技巧，再延伸至临床应用场景的具体解读，最终建立起个人健康决策所需的科学素养体系。\n\n学习医学研究阅读并非要求每个人都成为统计学专家或临床研究者。核心目标在于：能够识别一项研究的基本设计类型，理解其统计结论的含义与局限，判断证据的可靠程度，并将这些信息合理地应用于个人健康决策中。\n\n在信息爆炸的时代，健康类信息充斥着各种平台。具备医学研究阅读能力，意味着能够穿透营销话术和情绪化传播，回归到证据本身——这是每一个关注自身健康的现代人都值得拥有的素养。\n\n本 Hub 按照「研究方法论 → 证据评估 → 临床应用 → 健康素养」的逻辑递进编排，每个章节聚焦一个核心能力维度，帮助读者循序渐进地建立完整的医学文献阅读框架。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"research-methodology","title":"研究方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/research-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"research-design-types","title":"研究设计类型","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/research-methodology/research-design-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-methods-basics","title":"统计方法基础","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/research-methodology/statistical-methods-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"literature-search-skills","title":"文献检索技巧","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/research-methodology/literature-search-skills"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-evaluation","title":"证据评估","docCount":3,"url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/evidence-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evidence-hierarchy","title":"证据等级评估","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/evidence-evaluation/evidence-hierarchy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bias-identification","title":"偏倚识别","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/evidence-evaluation/bias-identification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"systematic-review-interpretation","title":"系统综述解读","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/evidence-evaluation/systematic-review-interpretation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"clinical-application","title":"临床应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/clinical-application","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-trial-interpretation","title":"临床试验解读","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/clinical-application/clinical-trial-interpretation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drug-development-process","title":"药物研发流程","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/clinical-application/drug-development-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"guidelines-and-consensus","title":"指南与共识","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/clinical-application/guidelines-and-consensus"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"health-literacy","title":"健康素养","docCount":3,"url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/health-literacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"health-information-evaluation","title":"健康信息甄别","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/health-literacy/health-information-evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"science-communication-literacy","title":"科学传播素养","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/health-literacy/science-communication-literacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"personal-decision-framework","title":"个人决策框架","url":"/h/health-medicine/reading-medical-research/health-literacy/personal-decision-framework"}]}]}